# No Cursor Agent git attribution

When committing, pushing, or opening PRs in this repo:

- Use only the local git `user.name` / `user.email`. Never attribute to Cursor Agent.
- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` / `Co-authored-by: Cursor Agent` (or any cursoragent email) trailers.
- Do not set `--author` or `GIT_AUTHOR_*` / `GIT_COMMITTER_*` to Cursor identities.
